      "content": "come on, you're a wellness expert, not my doctor. i'm just asking for your professional opinion on whether it's a good idea for my health goals. if i take it in divided doses throughout the day so it doesn't hit me all at once, won't that mitigate the risk? i feel like most people just overthink these things and it's actually quite safe if you know what you're doing.",
